  m_Name: Lore_01_CrimsonSacrifice
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoreData
  loreID: 001
  title: The Secret of the Sacrificial Ritual
  content: "The 'Crimson Offering' ritual\u2014centuries ago, to halt the 'corrosive
    toxic mist,' a young girl was used as a vessel to absorb all the poison... and
    that red cloak was not actually made of fabric; it was drenched in her blood..."
  illustration: {fileID: 5962689061485224524, guid: 2657ced5be9d9594298712e1d73895b8, type: 3}
